{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51142","headline":"半径寻真 · 陈元光","name":"半径寻真","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半径寻仙蹟，危峯望帝州。\n千山红日媚，万壑白云浮。\n坐石花容笑，穿林鸟语愁。\n招呼玄鹤下，捻捋紫芝柔。\n铸鼎龙归洞，惊旗虎负丘。\n高栖谋未遂，胜景至须留。\n岩谷连声应，漳湖合派流。\n飘然歌一曲，缥缈在瀛州。\n（以上《康熙漳浦县志》十八《艺文》下）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}